README.md
============================================================
# VideoVault

Generated by [CIaC](https://github.com/jrcalgo/ciac) — do not edit the
compiler-owned wiring by hand; regenerate it from the `.ciac` source
instead. Business logic lives in `src/services/`, which is yours.

## Run

```sh
cargo run
```

Or bring up the full stack (API, Postgres):

```sh
docker compose up --build
```

## Layout

| Path | Purpose | Owner |
|------|---------|-------|
| `src/main.rs` | Application assembly | compiler |
| `src/routes/` | HTTP routers (one per api) | compiler |
| `src/services/` | Business-logic handlers | **you** |
| `src/workers/` | Queue consumers and scheduled jobs | compiler |
| `src/config.rs` | Environment-driven settings | compiler |
